WEBVTT

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:09.000
Let's follow him.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:09.830
Zelada?

00:00:09.830 --> 00:00:12.450
He's gonna use that bomb. And right now, too.

00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:16.120
Stay close to me, Kei.

00:00:16.120 --> 00:00:19.120
I'm the only one who can
spot the enemy's ambush.

00:00:19.120 --> 00:00:21.410
If you're my partner, trust me.

00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:24.290
Got it.

00:01:57.540 --> 00:01:58.750
Leahyah!

00:02:01.080 --> 00:02:02.330
Wait! It's a trap!

00:02:02.330 --> 00:02:03.910
But I have to go!

00:02:03.910 --> 00:02:06.250
You're right but... Damn it!

00:02:09.160 --> 00:02:10.870
I don't know what the hell
to do with this thing.

00:02:10.870 --> 00:02:12.200
Then smash it!

00:02:12.200 --> 00:02:15.660
It may blow up if I mess with it.

00:02:15.660 --> 00:02:18.120
How do I disarm this?

00:02:18.120 --> 00:02:20.950
Is it even a bomb?

00:02:20.950 --> 00:02:24.620
What a reckless effort!

00:02:24.620 --> 00:02:30.750
I can assure you,
for your own safety, it's best to run.

00:02:30.750 --> 00:02:32.160
Damn you!

00:02:32.160 --> 00:02:34.330
When I see a guy with a grin like yours,

00:02:34.330 --> 00:02:37.250
nothing makes my day
more than messing up his plans.

00:02:37.250 --> 00:02:39.580
Oh, my... You know you're helpless.

00:02:39.580 --> 00:02:40.620
Shut up!

00:02:41.450 --> 00:02:43.370
See? You're helpless.

00:02:43.370 --> 00:02:45.410
It's an illusion!

00:02:45.410 --> 00:02:46.410
Above!

00:02:50.910 --> 00:02:51.910
Kei!

00:02:55.160 --> 00:02:57.870
Too bad, Sir Matoba!

00:02:57.870 --> 00:03:00.450
You've lost once more.

00:03:00.450 --> 00:03:02.290
Now, on to the next one...

00:03:02.950 --> 00:03:04.790
This is so much fun!

00:03:09.120 --> 00:03:11.750
Where is he? Damn it.

00:03:11.750 --> 00:03:13.160
I can't see him.

00:03:13.160 --> 00:03:15.450
No, don't rely on your eyes.

00:03:15.450 --> 00:03:17.950
Sound. Focus on the sound.

00:03:19.040 --> 00:03:20.160
The sound...

00:03:27.080 --> 00:03:28.450
Over there?

00:03:33.700 --> 00:03:34.950
What?

00:03:34.950 --> 00:03:37.080
Oh! The pain...!

00:03:48.250 --> 00:03:49.750
Well done.

00:03:49.750 --> 00:03:53.870
It's been 103 years since
I've been wounded like this.

00:03:56.790 --> 00:04:00.870
Stop talking and prepare to die, monster!

00:04:00.870 --> 00:04:04.580
No, I'm afraid it would bring shame
upon the Marzaney Sect

00:04:04.580 --> 00:04:08.330
if I were to die at the hands of a mere barshe.

00:04:08.330 --> 00:04:09.750
And thus...

00:04:11.700 --> 00:04:14.410
Farewell!

00:04:24.370 --> 00:04:25.370
Kei!

00:04:26.790 --> 00:04:31.580
I defeated Zelada.
But I don't have any elixirs to heal you.

00:04:31.580 --> 00:04:32.790
I'm sorry.

00:04:34.330 --> 00:04:37.330
R-Run...

00:04:41.750 --> 00:04:43.910
There's no time.

00:04:43.910 --> 00:04:46.910
I'm going to spend the last
moments of my life with her.

00:04:46.910 --> 00:04:48.410
You should be grateful.

00:04:48.410 --> 00:04:53.620
I've decided to die next to an uncouth,
boorish, and sarcastic man like you.

00:04:53.620 --> 00:04:56.160
I'd rather... you didn't...

00:04:57.000 --> 00:04:59.580
"My dear Leahyah..."

00:05:01.040 --> 00:05:05.290
Like I promised, I've come to save you.

00:05:05.290 --> 00:05:12.160
When I was a child, lost in the forest,
you saved me and showed me the way home.

00:05:12.160 --> 00:05:14.450
Remember what we promised then?

00:05:14.450 --> 00:05:17.160
That we'd always be friends.

00:05:17.160 --> 00:05:21.950
That's why I came.
I came, like I said I would.

00:05:21.950 --> 00:05:24.830
I didn't let you die alone.

00:05:24.830 --> 00:05:29.660
So Leahyah, don't be scared.
Let's stay together.

00:05:36.160 --> 00:05:38.700
Leahyah? No! Don't do it!

00:05:38.700 --> 00:05:40.870
Stop! Leahyah!

00:05:43.500 --> 00:05:44.750
Leahyah!

00:05:54.200 --> 00:05:55.450
"Peaceful color..."

00:05:55.830 --> 00:05:56.830
"Powerless color."

00:05:57.370 --> 00:05:59.790
"I beg you to give them more time."

00:06:00.040 --> 00:06:00.950
"Rarest of colors."

00:06:06.040 --> 00:06:07.410
I'm alive?

00:06:09.540 --> 00:06:10.540
What is this?

00:06:10.540 --> 00:06:13.250
I used a healing spell.

00:06:13.250 --> 00:06:17.700
I needed an elixir to heal
the damage the poison did.

00:06:17.700 --> 00:06:20.540
An elixir with powerful latena.

00:06:20.540 --> 00:06:22.200
An elixir?

00:06:22.200 --> 00:06:25.200
I used her body to make it.

00:06:25.200 --> 00:06:27.370
That fairy died?

00:06:28.540 --> 00:06:29.580
Yes.

00:06:31.160 --> 00:06:36.040
The catalyst for the psychic
bomb was a living fairy.

00:06:36.040 --> 00:06:38.250
She knew that, it seems.

00:06:42.290 --> 00:06:48.000
And she sacrificed her life to save me.

00:07:12.950 --> 00:07:15.330
Kei Matoba, thank you for everything.

00:07:15.330 --> 00:07:19.580
Um, well... You too.

00:07:19.580 --> 00:07:22.750
I may be returning home in shame
instead of dying with honor,

00:07:22.750 --> 00:07:26.370
but I learned that there are
some good warriors on Earth.

00:07:26.370 --> 00:07:28.790
Oh, you forgot something.

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:31.500
That's...

00:07:31.500 --> 00:07:33.830
I got it back from O'Neill.

00:07:33.830 --> 00:07:37.500
It's expensive, right?
Too expensive to give to a tour guide.

00:07:37.500 --> 00:07:38.120
But...

00:07:38.120 --> 00:07:39.910
Just take it.

00:07:48.250 --> 00:07:50.410
Bye.

00:07:51.410 --> 00:07:55.040
Farewell, gallant doreany soldier!

00:08:35.580 --> 00:08:37.750
Kuroi, I'm home.

00:08:45.330 --> 00:08:49.370
Amazing! Two three pointers in a row!

00:08:49.370 --> 00:08:51.000
What is this?

00:08:51.000 --> 00:08:52.620
A sports show.

00:08:52.620 --> 00:08:54.370
No idea what the rules are.

00:08:54.370 --> 00:08:56.250
No, you! You!

00:08:56.250 --> 00:08:57.790
What are you doing here?

00:08:57.790 --> 00:09:00.200
Oh, that?

00:09:00.200 --> 00:09:02.580
I changed my mind.

00:09:02.580 --> 00:09:05.000
We're not sure that Zelada's really dead.

00:09:05.000 --> 00:09:07.580
And this city is filled with villains.

00:09:07.580 --> 00:09:10.500
I figured there's more I can do.

00:09:10.500 --> 00:09:12.200
What?

00:09:16.370 --> 00:09:18.120
You're being treated as a detective?

00:09:18.120 --> 00:09:20.160
And working in my department?

00:09:20.160 --> 00:09:21.370
Yup.

00:09:21.370 --> 00:09:23.870
So I'll be staying here for a while.

00:09:23.870 --> 00:09:26.620
Any questions, partner?

00:09:27.790 --> 00:09:29.370
Part... ner?

00:09:37.870 --> 00:09:40.540
Tomorrow's gonna be an early morning.
Time for bed.

00:09:40.540 --> 00:09:42.000
Got it.

00:09:42.000 --> 00:09:43.250
Goodnight, Kei.

00:09:44.040 --> 00:09:46.290
"Night, Tilarna."

00:09:51.950 --> 00:09:53.910
This is the police! Open up!

00:09:53.910 --> 00:09:55.250
Shit! It's the cops!

00:09:55.250 --> 00:09:57.250
Who tipped them off?!

00:09:57.250 --> 00:09:58.370
Go! Go! Go!

00:10:16.040 --> 00:10:19.000
Make the slightest move and you're dead.

00:10:39.370 --> 00:10:40.540
Got it.

00:10:41.500 --> 00:10:44.700
Matoba! Exedilica! Get over here!

00:10:44.700 --> 00:10:45.750
Now!

00:10:50.040 --> 00:10:52.250
Chief Zimmer, is there a problem--

00:10:52.250 --> 00:10:55.830
Matoba, they tell me you chopped off
one of the gang member's arms.

00:10:55.830 --> 00:10:57.870
It wasn't me! It was her--

00:10:57.870 --> 00:11:00.200
Quiet! I don't care who it was.

00:11:00.200 --> 00:11:01.830
You two are a pair.

00:11:01.830 --> 00:11:04.950
If that alien there rapes a 100-year-old man...

00:11:04.950 --> 00:11:07.290
...it'd be the same as if you did it!

00:11:07.290 --> 00:11:09.540
I'd be calling you a pervert
for the rest of your life!

00:11:09.540 --> 00:11:11.250
--That's not--
--Don't worry.

00:11:11.250 --> 00:11:12.870
I'm a fair boss.

00:11:12.870 --> 00:11:15.040
So if your shit spills out of the toilet bowl,

00:11:15.040 --> 00:11:18.160
I'll make the alien there
clean it up with her tongue!

00:11:18.160 --> 00:11:20.200
We clear?

00:11:20.200 --> 00:11:21.500
Yes, sir.

00:11:21.500 --> 00:11:25.120
So, why did you chop off the guy's arm?

00:11:25.120 --> 00:11:27.750
His lawyer's gonna be overjoyed.

00:11:27.750 --> 00:11:29.450
It wasn't an arm. It was a finger.

00:11:29.450 --> 00:11:31.000
And Inspector Zimmer...

00:11:31.000 --> 00:11:33.250
Don't call me an alien.

00:11:33.250 --> 00:11:34.750
That's racist!

00:11:34.750 --> 00:11:37.500
Oh, is it?

00:11:37.500 --> 00:11:39.500
I'll keep that in mind.

00:11:40.200 --> 00:11:43.160
You know Gardner down at
the prosecutor's office, right?

00:11:43.160 --> 00:11:48.040
I'll talk to him, but I need a report
on my desk by 9:00 AM tomorrow!

00:11:48.040 --> 00:11:50.250
Don't even be a minute late!

00:11:50.250 --> 00:11:52.580
Uh... roger.

00:11:52.580 --> 00:11:54.700
That goes for you too, alien!

00:11:54.700 --> 00:11:57.500
Ask Matoba how to write it!

00:11:57.500 --> 00:12:02.580
He's pretty brutal.
So that's Roth's successor, huh?

00:12:02.580 --> 00:12:06.330
Why is he yelling at me?
I was carrying out justice!

00:12:06.330 --> 00:12:08.330
You went too far.

00:12:08.330 --> 00:12:10.120
It's because you let your guard down!

00:12:10.120 --> 00:12:11.790
It's your fault!

00:12:11.790 --> 00:12:15.160
I didn't ask for your help.

00:12:15.160 --> 00:12:17.620
I don't know how you can even say that.

00:12:17.620 --> 00:12:20.410
Would it kill you to say, "thank you"?

00:12:20.410 --> 00:12:22.200
--In the name of the great god Kizenya...
--Kei!

00:12:23.200 --> 00:12:24.620
Over here!

00:12:25.750 --> 00:12:28.750
We're being called.
You can pray next week.

00:12:31.200 --> 00:12:32.620
He's such a jerk!

00:12:34.660 --> 00:12:36.370
That hurt! What was that for?

00:12:36.370 --> 00:12:37.500
Shut up!

00:12:38.700 --> 00:12:40.500
Stop it! You're embarrassing me!

00:12:40.500 --> 00:12:41.660
Rakebye!

00:12:41.660 --> 00:12:43.870
Why are you flirting with her?

00:12:43.870 --> 00:12:45.330
I am not.

00:12:45.330 --> 00:12:46.910
Did something happen?

00:12:46.910 --> 00:12:48.500
We don't know.

00:12:48.500 --> 00:12:51.500
This garage belongs to the guys we just cuffed.

00:13:01.160 --> 00:13:02.500
A coffin?

00:13:04.000 --> 00:13:06.000
It's a little too strange for that.

00:13:06.000 --> 00:13:08.250
Does it belong to a Semanian?

00:13:08.250 --> 00:13:09.500
I don't know.

00:13:09.500 --> 00:13:12.500
I've seen these letters in an old book.

00:13:12.500 --> 00:13:16.250
Moon... Forbidden... Blood.

00:13:16.250 --> 00:13:17.950
That's all I can read.

00:13:17.950 --> 00:13:19.040
What's inside?

00:13:19.040 --> 00:13:21.080
What if it's some valuable work of art?

00:13:21.080 --> 00:13:22.450
We need to be careful with it.

00:13:22.450 --> 00:13:24.700
Who gives a shit? Smash it open.

00:13:30.700 --> 00:13:31.910
Is that...

00:13:32.750 --> 00:13:34.620
...a mummy?

00:13:34.620 --> 00:13:37.250
It looks like a princess or something to me.

00:13:47.200 --> 00:13:51.370
I can't be sure, but it looks
like a Semanian woman.

00:13:51.370 --> 00:13:52.450
Of course it is.

00:13:52.450 --> 00:13:58.120
It's a mummy in Semanian clothes,
found in a Semanian coffin.

00:13:58.120 --> 00:14:00.160
They have a different number of teeth.

00:14:00.160 --> 00:14:02.450
Humans have 32 teeth.

00:14:02.450 --> 00:14:04.500
But Semanians have 28.

00:14:10.000 --> 00:14:12.620
I'll give her an autopsy if you want, I guess,

00:14:12.620 --> 00:14:14.830
but we deal in fresh corpses, not mummies.

00:14:14.830 --> 00:14:19.500
You'd be better off giving her to
an archaeologist, don't you think?

00:14:19.500 --> 00:14:21.620
We can send her to a lab when you're done.

00:14:21.620 --> 00:14:23.790
Time of death. Age. Cause of death.

00:14:23.790 --> 00:14:26.540
I want to know all of that tonight.

00:14:26.540 --> 00:14:30.910
Kei, I've been on the clock since this morning.

00:14:30.910 --> 00:14:34.080
What a coincidence! Me too.

00:14:34.080 --> 00:14:36.040
You're such a jerk.

00:14:36.040 --> 00:14:37.580
I agree.

00:14:37.580 --> 00:14:38.700
Right?

00:14:38.700 --> 00:14:41.910
I'm amazed you decided
to stay here and work with him.

00:14:41.910 --> 00:14:43.790
I think it was temporary insanity.

00:14:43.790 --> 00:14:46.000
I deeply regret it now.

00:14:46.000 --> 00:14:47.040
I know, right?

00:14:47.040 --> 00:14:48.910
He's cold and mean.

00:14:48.910 --> 00:14:51.660
But once in a while, he's nice
and it catches you off guard!

00:14:51.660 --> 00:14:53.700
Make sure you don't let him fool you.

00:14:53.700 --> 00:14:56.500
I don't really understand,
but I'll remember that.

00:14:56.500 --> 00:14:57.830
Hey.

00:14:57.830 --> 00:15:00.750
You wouldn't believe what
happened the first day we met.

00:15:00.750 --> 00:15:03.750
He brings me the body of
some gang member he just killed,

00:15:03.750 --> 00:15:05.370
and then do you know what he says?

00:15:05.370 --> 00:15:07.910
"Don't steal the change out of his pockets"!

00:15:07.910 --> 00:15:08.830
I know what you mean!

00:15:08.830 --> 00:15:12.700
I saved his life today, and he said
he didn't ask for my help!

00:15:12.700 --> 00:15:15.330
Next time something happens,
I'm just going to let him die.

00:15:15.330 --> 00:15:16.790
Smart.

00:15:16.790 --> 00:15:19.700
When he dies, why don't we dissect him together?

00:15:19.700 --> 00:15:22.040
We can slit open his stomach and take a selfie!

00:15:25.160 --> 00:15:27.290
I love it, Bozah Epps!

00:15:27.290 --> 00:15:28.950
Make sure you invite me.

00:15:28.950 --> 00:15:31.830
Call me Cecil, Miss Exedilica.

00:15:31.830 --> 00:15:34.450
Cecil, you can call me Tilarna, too!

00:15:36.080 --> 00:15:38.200
You're sure getting friendly fast.

00:15:38.200 --> 00:15:42.540
Dr. Epps, the results of the lab test are in.

00:15:42.540 --> 00:15:45.160
There's nothing wrong with
being friendly with our clients,

00:15:45.160 --> 00:15:47.290
but don't forget to do your job.

00:15:47.290 --> 00:15:49.790
Okay. I'll be right there.

00:15:53.790 --> 00:15:56.000
What's his problem?

00:15:56.000 --> 00:15:57.830
He's your apprentice, right?

00:15:57.830 --> 00:15:59.200
My assistant.

00:15:59.200 --> 00:16:01.750
He doesn't like me.

00:16:01.750 --> 00:16:05.540
It might be the other way around.
He may have a crush on you.

00:16:05.540 --> 00:16:08.040
Oh, are you worried?

00:16:08.040 --> 00:16:09.700
Quiet.

00:16:09.700 --> 00:16:11.290
I'll wait to hear from you, then.

00:16:17.410 --> 00:16:19.040
I'm a little worried.

00:16:19.040 --> 00:16:22.750
Bodies like that aren't something
to be touched lightly.

00:16:22.750 --> 00:16:26.290
If you're worried about bacteria, don't be.
Cecil's a pro.

00:16:26.290 --> 00:16:29.790
No. The spirits of the deceased
are drawn to corpses.

00:16:29.790 --> 00:16:31.660
It's best not to touch them.

00:16:31.660 --> 00:16:34.250
That's not an option. She's evidence.

00:16:34.250 --> 00:16:36.950
And she might belong to some noble somewhere.

00:16:40.000 --> 00:16:41.250
Anyway...

00:16:43.120 --> 00:16:45.410
Are you close to Cecil?

00:16:45.410 --> 00:16:48.160
I explained this before, didn't I?

00:16:48.160 --> 00:16:50.040
That "ex" word, was it?

00:16:50.040 --> 00:16:52.200
It wasn't in the dictionary.

00:16:52.200 --> 00:16:54.910
Don't worry about it. We're still friends.

00:16:58.000 --> 00:16:59.450
Wait.

00:16:59.450 --> 00:17:01.950
Still? What does that mean?

00:17:01.950 --> 00:17:03.160
Forget it.

00:17:06.620 --> 00:17:09.620
I ain't talking to no cop.

00:17:11.200 --> 00:17:13.000
Bring me my damn lawyer.

00:17:17.910 --> 00:17:21.040
Villain! Start talking!

00:17:22.160 --> 00:17:27.250
Do you know what happens
to criminals who defile corpses?

00:17:29.080 --> 00:17:31.200
Their limbs are cut off
while they're still alive

00:17:31.200 --> 00:17:33.580
before they're stuffed into a barrel
filled with poison insects

00:17:33.580 --> 00:17:36.370
and left there overnight,
and then thrown into the Obiza swamp!

00:17:36.370 --> 00:17:39.750
If you don't want that to happen to you,
start talking about that coffin!

00:17:41.450 --> 00:17:43.200
I thought you'd do that...

00:17:44.620 --> 00:17:50.410
A body of unknown origin,
kept in a Semanian coffin.

00:17:50.410 --> 00:17:52.500
The teeth and cervical vertebrae

00:17:52.500 --> 00:17:55.450
suggest that she is a Semanian female.

00:17:55.450 --> 00:17:58.700
Simultaneous signs of desiccation and aging.

00:17:58.700 --> 00:18:02.120
It's a strange form of mummification
that you don't see on Earth.

00:18:02.120 --> 00:18:05.500
This is an archaeological examination
that does not require autopsy.

00:18:12.200 --> 00:18:13.200
Chapman!

00:18:15.620 --> 00:18:16.750
Chapman!

00:18:18.870 --> 00:18:20.540
Yes?

00:18:20.540 --> 00:18:23.450
Can you take a CT scan of the body?

00:18:24.660 --> 00:18:26.080
Sure thing.

00:18:26.950 --> 00:18:28.620
Right now.

00:18:41.540 --> 00:18:44.620
Please don't hurt me...

00:18:44.620 --> 00:18:47.500
We stole the coffin.

00:18:47.500 --> 00:18:49.580
We heard it was worth a lot, so...

00:18:49.580 --> 00:18:52.200
Where did you steal it? Tell me!

00:18:52.200 --> 00:18:56.250
Doras Derill. A graveyard in Doras Derill...

00:18:56.250 --> 00:18:57.370
What?

00:19:01.620 --> 00:19:03.910
A corpse from Doras Derill?

00:19:03.910 --> 00:19:05.040
What's up?

00:19:06.000 --> 00:19:08.660
Cecil may be in danger!

00:19:08.660 --> 00:19:09.910
What?

00:19:09.910 --> 00:19:10.910
Hurry!

00:19:12.330 --> 00:19:13.660
Hey!

00:19:13.660 --> 00:19:14.910
Shit.

00:19:36.910 --> 00:19:38.370
Did something happen?

00:19:43.290 --> 00:19:44.330
Chapman?

00:19:51.200 --> 00:19:52.370
What's going on?

00:20:51.500 --> 00:20:54.450
"Shield of law, protection of the war god."

00:21:01.750 --> 00:21:02.790
Cecil!

00:21:04.580 --> 00:21:05.580
Tilarna?

00:21:09.450 --> 00:21:11.620
Tilarna... The body...

00:21:11.620 --> 00:21:12.910
